    "reason": "The linked PR has the label area/ci [ev-b80424743651], and the only file it changes is .github/workflows/update.yaml [ev-c234078b6665]. So \"Skip release candidates on updates\" [ev-0f1afb29729f] changes upstream's own CI workflow for dependency updates. It does not change how the shipped Flux CLI or controllers behave. A protocol-behavior behavior-changed assertion about Flux therefore misreads the entry, and no customer-facing assertion follows from it.",
